Z||000001||deceler8||11-13-2000||02:57 PM||||Not being an expert, I believe the 84-86 ECM's are the same...<P>In 1987, the four went to DIS and a newer TBI unit and there were changes to the six as well. <P>||||reg||1
Z||000002||terryk||11-13-2000||04:41 PM||||V6 are essentially the same 6869 and 7170. <BR>L4 is 6465 and 7748. Different beasts.<P>Which engine are you asking about?||||reg||1
Z||000003||kslish||11-13-2000||04:51 PM||||If you are talking about V6 computers, I've heard that the '85 V6 ECM is capable of utilizing a engine knock sensor.  Not sure how you would wire one in though, never really looked into it. ||||reg||1
